# the forced arms of darksamus_fsm2_force.py: five Interrupt messages, Taunt activations (alternating with Interrupt),
# a NormalMissileAttack and a SuperMissileAttack long enough for their exit arms, and a PhazonSuck (its taunt command).
@f600 send u04f7 Activate
@f700 fsm u04f7 Taunt
@f730 fsm u04f7 Interrupt
@f760 fsm u04f7 Interrupt
@f800 fsm u04f7 Taunt
@f820 fsm u04f7 Interrupt
@f840 fsm u04f7 Taunt
@f855 fsm u04f7 Interrupt
@f875 fsm u04f7 Taunt
@f890 fsm u04f7 Interrupt
@f910 fsm u04f7 Taunt
@f925 fsm u04f7 Interrupt
@f945 fsm u04f7 Taunt
@f960 fsm u04f7 Interrupt
@f980 fsm u04f7 Taunt
@f995 fsm u04f7 Interrupt
@f1015 fsm u04f7 Taunt
@f1030 fsm u04f7 Interrupt
@f1050 fsm u04f7 Taunt
@f1065 fsm u04f7 Interrupt
@f1085 fsm u04f7 Taunt
@f1100 fsm u04f7 NormalMissileAttack
@f1300 fsm u04f7 SuperMissileAttack
@f1600 fsm u04f7 Taunt
@f1650 fsm u04f7 PhazonSuck
@f1700 objs dark
